      "content": "it's not just \"intense feelings\" though. it's the reality of it. i look at the damage i caused and i realize that i'm fundamentally broken. like, if a machine is built wrong and it causes a disaster, you don't just \"navigate through it,\" you scrap it. you don't keep using something that's dangerous and tainted. i feel like i'm just... inherently toxic now. there's no \"path forward\" for someone who is fundamentally a net negative to the world.",
